source_event:           dejagnu/1.6.3 CI rounds (progress.json jc6_fixes round-2/round-4: refs/remotes/origin/main 过时 26b0cd39.. → incremental 误报 1321 包; update-ref 修复后 full 模式 JC6 跳过单软件检查)
draft:                  true
